      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Directions\r\nFrom Castleblayney town centre, take the R181 (Shercock Road). Turn left onto Bree and continue. The property will be on your Right -hand side. See Sale sign Beattie Real Estate."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
